    {
      "id": "node-note",
      "type": "builder:flow.note",
      "x": 80,
      "y": 560,
      "displayName": "",
      "value": "Parallel mining and safety guard example:\n\nStart has two links:\n1. Checker branch\n2. Mining branch\n\nThe checker branch loops Alive -> In Water -> Low Health -> Low Hunger -> Checker Wait -> Alive.\nWhen EDIT Checker Wait is counting, only the checker branch waits. The mining branch can keep working.\n\nThe mining branch now has its own safety gates before Mine Area:\nMINE Guard Alive -> MINE Guard Water -> MINE Guard Health -> MINE Guard Hunger -> MINE EDIT Box.\n\nThat means water or low health stops the mining branch before the next Mine Area run, even if the checker branch is waiting.\n\nEdit these:\nMINE EDIT Box: relative mine area and auto_tool options.\nEDIT Low Health and MINE Guard Health: health number, default 6.\nEDIT Low Hunger and MINE Guard Hunger: food number, default 6.\nEDIT Checker Wait: safety check delay, 1000 = 1 second.\n\nIdle Until cannot directly check low health or water in this build. Use these guard components for that.\n\nUse in a safe test world first.",
      "value2": "",
      "value3": "",
      "value4": "",
      "value5": "",
      "delayMs": -1,
      "enabled": true,
      "stickyNoteText": "Parallel mining and safety guard example:\n\nStart has two links:\n1. Checker branch\n2. Mining branch\n\nThe checker branch loops Alive -> In Water -> Low Health -> Low Hunger -> Checker Wait -> Alive.\nWhen EDIT Checker Wait is counting, only the checker branch waits. The mining branch can keep working.\n\nThe mining branch now has its own safety gates before Mine Area:\nMINE Guard Alive -> MINE Guard Water -> MINE Guard Health -> MINE Guard Hunger -> MINE EDIT Box.\n\nThat means water or low health stops the mining branch before the next Mine Area run, even if the checker branch is waiting.\n\nEdit these:\nMINE EDIT Box: relative mine area and auto_tool options.\nEDIT Low Health and MINE Guard Health: health number, default 6.\nEDIT Low Hunger and MINE Guard Hunger: food number, default 6.\nEDIT Checker Wait: safety check delay, 1000 = 1 second.\n\nIdle Until cannot directly check low health or water in this build. Use these guard components for that.\n\nUse in a safe test world first.",
      "stickyNoteWidth": 760,
